WEBVTT

00:38:29.038 --> 00:38:31.329
I mean, some of them, the ones
who've lost their jobs,

00:38:31.829 --> 00:38:37.204
some of them like in Africa and India, you
know, they live by selling things.

00:38:37.621 --> 00:38:41.538
And what they get selling their little
bits and pieces is how they eat in

00:38:41.538 --> 00:38:44.121
the evening and provide food
for their children.

00:38:44.746 --> 00:38:49.496
So advice that you were giving to them
would be totally different from somebody

00:38:49.496 --> 00:38:53.163
sitting in Silicon Valley, you know,

00:38:53.163 --> 00:38:59.413
with his pots of money and ability to
communicate with people around the world

00:38:59.413 --> 00:39:03.746
and think of new ways of making more
money or making more inventions,